WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.890
Blackbeard might be the smartest Character
in One Piece. Yes, I know, just like Luffy

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:12.290
he often does very impulsive and foolish things,
like for example almost being wiped out by

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:18.119
Maggelan in Impel down. But when you really
think about it, Marshal D. Teach had a plan

00:00:18.119 --> 00:00:24.670
that was over 20 years in the making and he
executed it perfectly, basically playing the

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:30.380
entire world, which I have to respect. He
joined Whitebeard as a teenager already with

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:36.030
the intention to get his hands on the most
powerful logia devil fruit, the yami yami

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:40.969
no mi. He then waited patiently on board of
the yonko's ship, keeping his head low and

00:00:40.969 --> 00:00:46.930
biding his time. All that, despite being ridiculously
powerful all the while. Remember, he was able

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:58.550
to hurt Shanks, one of the strongest people
out there. [Shanks saying he was not careless]

00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:03.390
So instead of showing of his powers, he kept
a low profile, already recruiting people for

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:09.270
his future crew until finally, one of his
crew mates actually got his hands on the devil

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:15.010
fruit he was hunting for. Then he took his
chance, killed his comrade of over 20 years,

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:21.960
ate the fruit and left the crew. I'm already
impressed with the patience this man had.

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:29.939
Just like Luffy, he always trusts in fate
to find a way for him, and it has always worked

00:01:29.939 --> 00:01:35.630
out so far. But the next phase of his plan
is even more impressive, and I can't believe

00:01:35.630 --> 00:01:42.180
I never put 1 and 1 together in my head. Because
Blackbeard basically orchestrated most of

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:47.320
the major events in the story. Maybe that
was obvious to you, but to me that actually

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:53.619
blew my mind. Think about it: Blackbeard goal
after finally consuming his ultimate fruit

00:01:53.619 --> 00:01:58.729
was going for the one piece right away. For
that he needed to join the Yonko and become

00:01:58.729 --> 00:02:04.960
a force to compete with the likes of Kaido
and Big Mom. So what does he do? He decides

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:10.060
to get the strongest crew possible. And if
you don't have the patience or charisma of

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:16.220
Luffy, or are as romantically active as Big
Mom, Blackbeard figured that he'd grab himself

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:30.440
the strongest people available to him. But
how to get into the most secure place on the

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:38.290
entire planet except for maybe marijoe? Easiest
answer: Ally yourself with the world government,

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:45.180
so they basically invite you in. So now Blackbeards
first step is becoming a warloard. He think

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:50.069
about hunting down Luffy to get on the good
side with the marines, but fails. Luffy after

00:02:50.069 --> 00:02:57.550
all, just like him is special, something Blackbeard
knows very well. And so fate offers him a

00:02:57.550 --> 00:03:02.330
different solution. I'm of course talking
about Ace, who was hunting after Blackbeard

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:06.870
to bring him to justice. At first Teach tries
to recruit him into his ranks. He knows how

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:11.810
strong and capable his former commander is.
But once he realizes that Ace is intent on

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:18.060
bringing him back to Whitebeard, a new opportunity
opens up. He realizes, that not only can he

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:24.019
use Ace as a bargaining chip to become a warlord,
but he can even orchestrate everything, so

00:03:24.019 --> 00:03:30.090
the Marines will take on his former captain.
After all, Teach also had his eyes on the

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:35.640
strongest paramecia, Whitebeards Gura Gura
no mi. He would have to get past the man at

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:42.360
some point anyways and get his devil fruit
and now he had all the cards he needed to

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:46.629
play his big round.
He delivers Ace to the government, receiving

00:03:46.629 --> 00:03:51.819
the status of a warlord. He then enters impel
down, gathers all the powerful people he wants

00:03:51.819 --> 00:03:56.830
into his crew and then leaves directly for
Marineford, where the Marines and the whitebeard

00:03:56.830 --> 00:04:10.030
army had already starkly weakened each other.
Arriving with a fresh force of legendary pirates,

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:15.739
he takes advantage of the situation, kills
whitebeard and takes his devil fruit, only

00:04:15.739 --> 00:04:22.380
fleeing when Shanks arrives. Finally he has
become a Yonko and is now able to seriously

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:28.030
go after the One Piece, being at least on
eye level with even the most powerful people

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:33.780
in the one piece world. All of that based
on a plan he had as a 16 year old. I mean,

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:38.860
if that doesn't make him one of the most genius
characters in the story, I don't know what

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:45.310
to tell you. Actually I do: If you want weekly
One Piece content, Subscribe right now! Done?

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:50.020
Nice. I even a new Blackbeard theory for you
in this video as well.

