00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:27.820
You probably already know that Blackbeard
is written as a foil to Luffy. That means

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:36.130
that both characters share a lot of similarities,
but are the exact opposite in other aspects.

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:40.949
Teach is probably Luffy's biggest rival when
it comes to becoming pirate king. He's the

00:06:40.949 --> 00:06:44.900
only antagonist in the story where I'm really
concerned for Luffy and the other straw hats

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:49.889
when the battle between the two undoubtedly
will happen. Because Blackbeard shares two

00:06:49.889 --> 00:06:56.169
of Luffy's most important traits: Believing
in his dream and trusting in fate to guide

00:06:56.169 --> 00:07:02.710
him. The only thing Blackbeard doesn't have,
is Luffy's compassion for others. He is cunning,

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:09.220
meticulous, patient, manipulative, and cheats
his way to what he wants while Luffy is oblivious,

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:15.130
reckless, impulsive, selfless, and often takes
the burden upon himself in order to accomplish

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:22.560
what he wants. Oda basically smashes these
similarities into our faces during their first

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:34.300
meeting on Jaya. There is so much symbolism
there, that I made an entire video about it,

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:39.800
that I encourage you to watch after this one.
Both of their journeys are the exact opposite

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:44.750
of each other. But what I found the most interesting
herehowever, is that both Luffy and Blackbeard

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:48.690
wouldn't be where they are today without the
other. Think about it.

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:54.169
Luffy begins his journey by obtaining a seemingly
weak devil fruit through a father-like relationship

00:07:54.169 --> 00:08:02.139
with a Yonko; Blackbeard begins his journey
by stealing a strong devil fruit while breaking

00:08:02.139 --> 00:08:12.960
his father-like relationship with a Yonko.
Blackbeard banishes Wapol from Drum Kingdom

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:18.590
and leaves it as a nation without a king;
Luffy banishes Wapol from Drum Kingdom and

00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:25.120
leaves it as a brand new nation with a king.
As a result Luffy can recruit chopper.

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:30.000
Luffy sails through the first half of the
Grand Line taking down the Shichibukai; Blackbeard

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:34.050
sails through the first half of the Grand
Line hoping to become a Shichibukai. But only

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:39.290
when Luffy takes out Crocodile, does Blackbeard
get his chance.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:44.320
Luffy declares war on the World Government;
Blackbeard joins the World Government. Luffy

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:50.810
infiltrates Impel down in order to rescue
Ace; Blackbeard is only successful in recruiting

00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:57.410
the Level 6 pirates because of the rebellion
Luffy starts in Impel Down; yet Luffy is only

00:08:57.410 --> 00:09:03.000
able to enter and influence the war at Marineford
before Blackbeard’s crew hypnotized the

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:09.140
staff who control the Gates of Justice. Luffy
uses his astounding will to live to recover

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:16.490
from Magellan’s poison, Blackbeard cheats
and relies on an antidote to do the same.

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:23.820
Luffy’s will is broken at Marineford while
Blackbeard’s will is vindicated. The lowest

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:31.520
point of our hero is the highest of his antagonist.
Even the way they become Yonko is opposed

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:35.580
- Blackbeard defeated a weakened Whitebeard
and the scattered remnants of the Whitebeard

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:43.580
Pirates while Luffy will defeat a fully-powered
Kaido and his entire army of Beast Pirates.

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:52.480
Also, while he will surely be the main antagonist
on Laugh Tale, as we know, there is an even

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:57.180
bigger villain to defeat in the story. Imu,
whom I made this massive theory here about

00:09:57.180 --> 00:10:03.800
in case you haven't watched it yet. Blackbeard
is a villain, yes, but he also lives with

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:10.990
exactly the same mentality that Luffy does;&nbsp;He
wants his freedom and he believes in his dreams

00:10:10.990 --> 00:10:17.750
of a new age. So Blackbeard embodies the same
path as luffy, but he will ultimately lose.

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:28.930
Because Luffy is reaching the top of the world,
the 'right way',

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:33.660
So what's the take-away here? It's that Blackbeard
is one of the most influential characters

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:38.680
in the story. Someone instilled the idea of
the Yami Yami no mi in his head as a kid and

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:43.430
just like Luffy he spent his whole life aiming
to become pirate king. And so, of course this

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:49.670
wouldn't be a proper Blackbeard video, if
we didn't theorize a little bit. Or actually

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:50.720
a lot. Hehe.

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:56.540
The big question is of course, where Blackbeard
got his drive from. Who told him about the

00:10:56.540 --> 00:11:01.480
Yami-yami no mi and why does he want to become
pirate king? At this point I think it would

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:08.800
be pretty surprising if Blackbeard was NOT
related to Rocks D Zebek in like any way.

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:13.089
Since Blackbeard and Luffy mirror each other,
that means that Blackbeard also shares not

00:11:13.089 --> 00:11:21.141
only the concept of dreams, but also that
of inherited will with our protagonist. When

00:11:21.141 --> 00:11:26.710
you consider how shanks inspired Luffy's journey,
seeing in him the one who could inherit Roger's

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:32.680
will, it would make a lot of sense if Luffy's
major competitor would inherit the will of

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:43.209
Roger's biggest threat. And Blackbeard has
not only made Beehive island, Rocks' former

00:11:43.209 --> 00:11:48.610
headquarter, the center of his operation,
but he even named his main ship after the

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:56.639
man, who's name no-one is supposed to know,
the Saber of Xebec. Most people today don't

00:11:56.639 --> 00:12:03.490
even know Rocks existed, and those that do
only remember him as Rocks, not his last name.

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:09.620
So Blackbeard clearly must have had a personal
connection or at least deep fascination with

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:11.399
the man. I know what you're thinking now:

00:12:11.399 --> 00:12:17.710
So is Blackbeard Rocks'n son? Time-line wise
I think it would work out pretty well. Blackbeard

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:24.850
is 40 years old and grew up as an orphan.
Rocks was killed 38 years ago. This would

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:29.209
mean that Blackbeard was 2 years old when
Rocks died and should Rocks have been his

00:12:29.209 --> 00:12:32.950
father, his death would leave the two-year-old
Blackbeard on his own, which would be in line

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:34.480
with the depiction of a poor kid Blackbeard
that Oda released previously. It's quite possible

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:41.310
that Blackbeard resented Whitebeard for leaving
his father to die, while he, Kaido and Big

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:42.310
Mom lived.

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:47.660
A character that might give us some hints
at Teache's backstory is actually Orochi.

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:53.370
Yes I know no-one wants to hear about Orochi.
But listen to this. Orochi was born to the

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:59.240
persecuted Kurozumi clan, one of the six royal
families of Wano. Interestingly enough, Kurozumi

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:04.530
is the only family whose name does not have
the kanji for “moon” in it. Instead, it

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:10.000
translates into “Black Charcoal”. Through
backstabbing and trickery, he has climbed

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:15.380
his way into a position that is not his. Not
only that, he has killed and betrayed the

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:20.390
very people who took him under all in the
name of revenge. Furthermore, he has demonstrated

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:37.700
himself to be a coward in the face of danger
and/or death. This parallels Blackbeard pretty

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:42.990
nicely. Even though he is a member of the
D. Clan, he doesn't share much of the classical

00:13:42.990 --> 00:13:50.510
D. traits. Strongly willed, positive individuals
with a stark sense of compassion and loyalty,

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:54.131
laughing in the face of death. [bb scared
of death] Both Orochi and Blackbeard share

00:13:54.131 --> 00:13:55.610
very similar introductions in chapters 925
and 929. Both Orochi and Blackbeard also executed

00:13:55.610 --> 00:14:01.910
and ridiculed the person who took them in,
broadcasting the event. We know that Blackbeard

00:14:01.910 --> 00:14:08.089
doesn't sleep and neither did Orochi as a
kid, claiming that he was too scared. Both

00:14:08.089 --> 00:14:14.139
getting handed devil fruit powers to secure
their power. Could Orochi's persecution and

00:14:14.139 --> 00:14:19.740
quest for revenge be a hint at Blackbeard's
childhood, for being the son of the most dangerous

00:14:19.740 --> 00:14:21.160
man on the planet?

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:26.079
And of course I also want to talk about Blackbeard's
ability to have multiple devil fruits. And

00:14:26.079 --> 00:14:31.100
I have theory, I bet you didn't hear yet.
Now there are a few really popular ideas out

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:36.269
there. One is that it's a special feature
of the Yami Yami no mi to absorb powers. However,

00:14:36.269 --> 00:14:41.190
given how notorious the fruit is, it's very
unlikely that the gorosei wouldn't know about

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:45.980
it. Same goes for the Cerberus fruit theory.
Though I like that a bit more. A newer theory

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:50.710
I really enjoyed and that you might have heard
about is that Blackbeard is actually a squid,

00:14:50.710 --> 00:14:55.910
who have three heats and heigh arms, just
like the three heads and eight crossbones

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:57.519
on his Jolly Roger.

00:14:57.519 --> 00:15:01.490
However I have stumbled across another theory,
I don't think I've seen discussed anywhere

00:15:01.490 --> 00:15:05.990
before, even though I sadly don't know the
author. Hear me out. Blackbeard might be inspired

00:15:05.990 --> 00:15:11.880
by the Barbarossa brothers or red beard brothers.
Here’s the story: there were 3 brothers

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:15.529
Arudj, Khizir and Isaak. Their mother was
named Katarina (same as Blackbeard’s crewmate).

00:15:15.529 --> 00:15:20.030
The older one, Arudj, was a pirate while his
2 brothers were working with their father.

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:25.160
After the father’s death, the two brothers
joined Arudj and became pirates with him under

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:29.449
the Crescent Moon flag. You know what is Catarina
Devon from Blackbeard Pirates nicknamed? The

00:15:29.449 --> 00:15:35.709
Crescent Moon Hunter. The number 3 is closely
connected to Blackbeard. He has 3 guns. His

00:15:35.709 --> 00:15:41.790
Pirates flag features 3 skulls, and we all
know that a pirate flag describes the captain.

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:53.740
And we have of course this notorious scene
on Jaya. [] As I explain in detail in this

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:58.889
video, the Blackbeard that Luffy meets in
the bar and the one he meets outside are clearly

00:15:58.889 --> 00:16:04.200
different people. Luffy doesn't recognize
the man he fought with about cherry pies,

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:09.829
and both him and Zoro clearly state that Blackbeard
is multiple people.

00:16:09.829 --> 00:16:19.480
Remember this moment from impel down? [Blackbeard
tells luffy that his haki/will has improved]

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:25.210
Blackbeard says Luffy's haki has improved.
But he would only know that if Luffy had used

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:31.300
it on Jaya. In other words, him and Zoro unconsciously
used their observation haki here, all riled

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:33.509
up from the fight in the bar.

00:16:33.509 --> 00:16:39.460
So here is the twist: Blackbeard has 2 other
twin brothers. There are 3 Blackbeard's in

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:44.390
total. And so when he ate the yami yami fruit,
that is explicitly shown as capable of absorbing

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:51.550
humans, he was joined by his 2 brothers, just
as in the Barbarossa story. He hid his 2 brothers

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:57.030
inside him, which might explain why Blackbeard
was still eating the pie when Luffy left the

00:16:57.030 --> 00:17:04.010
bar, cause it was a different brother. Either
that or he just eats like hell- which I admit

00:17:04.010 --> 00:17:09.530
is also entirely possible. Having 3 different
people would also explain the varying personalties

00:17:09.530 --> 00:17:29.020
Teach displays. On marienford, he had to cover
himself up to let his brother out and had

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:33.610
him eat Whitebeards fruit. And When you saw
Blackbeard in Marineford with 2 different

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:39.860
powers in each hand, the hand that used Whitebeard’s
ability wasn’t actually Teach’s hand.

00:17:39.860 --> 00:17:45.900
It was his brother’s. Teach used Yami Yami
no Mi to pull his hand inside him, and let

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:50.820
out his brother’s hand. If you think that
he uses a different Devil Fruit with each

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:54.250
half of his body, I think you're wrong:

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:59.770
Teach has the Gura Gura power is his right
hand. Yami Yami in his left hand. Now look

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:00.970
at this:

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:08.100
The Yami Yami is now in his right hand, and
he uses Gura Gura with his left hand.Now look

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:09.830
at Blackbeard’s right hand:

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:12.010
And compare it to this one:

00:18:12.010 --> 00:18:18.059
The rings in his right hand disappeared. Now
this COULD of course be Oda being a bit sloppy

00:18:18.059 --> 00:18:23.190
here with the drawing, but it what if it's
not? Don't you also ever get the feeling that

00:18:23.190 --> 00:18:31.549
Teach looks. DIFFERENT. Whenever we see him.
Could that be the other brothers? The biggest

00:18:31.549 --> 00:18:38.130
give-away however might be his teeth. No matter
how many panels I compared, different versions

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:44.611
of blackbeard have different levels of dental
hygiene I guess? One has a lot of gaps, one

00:18:44.611 --> 00:18:50.410
just a few and this one here doesn't have
any at all. It's only in the manga, but it's

00:18:50.410 --> 00:18:55.539
definitley deliberately done. There is the
cruel one with a complete set of teeth that

00:18:55.539 --> 00:19:01.210
we see in impel down, the one with one middle
tooth, that we meet in the bar on jaya, and

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:07.110
finally one with the two gaps on the top right,
which is the most common version, and thus

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:11.790
I would guess the Teach that ate the Yami
Yami no mi. Teach ate the strongest Logia.

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:17.090
His brother ate the strongest Paramecia by
transferring the fruit as shown on punk hazard.

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:21.770
And now there’s the third brother left,
and he’ll probably eat the strongest Mythical

00:19:21.770 --> 00:19:22.770
Zoan.

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:29.010
If you want to fully understand how important
Blackbeard is however, I strongly recommend

00:19:29.010 --> 00:19:33.460
you check out my scene analysis with him and
Luffy here. Thanks for watching.

